,"photo_path":"B03P05.jpg"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[113.93443,22.27715]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"record_no":"P06","box_no":"B03","photo_no":"B03P06","remarks_raw":"伯公 龍井頭村口","Location_note":"伯公 龍井頭村口","latitude":22.27715,"longitude":113.93443,"coordinate_source":"Google Maps (user-provided) + OpenStreetMap + HK Gov sources + Tung Chung Tai O Study Report (PDF)","coordinate_confidence":"MEDIUM","coordinate_note":"龍井頭 (Lung Tseng Tau), Tung Chung (東涌), Lantau Island (大嶼山), Hong Kong. Coordinates: Google Maps (22.277148, 113.934428). Ref: Tung Chung–Tai O Study Report (東涌至大澳研究報告), PDF p.98 (printed p.70) Table 37: '龍井頭村的歷史建築／歷史地點：龍井頭神壇（伯公）' — Address: 龍井頭村; Purpose: 神明崇拜 (deity worship); Description: '有一紅色方框寫上橫批以及對聯，堆砌了幾塊石頭供奉伯公，後面有樹叢。' This directly matches the photo note '伯公 龍井頭村口' (P06) and '春節間的伯公（龍井頭）' (P07) — the 伯公 shrine at 龍井頭 village entrance. Also: PDF p.96 (printed p.68) §3.1.4 describes the village. PDF p.171 (printed p.143): 伯公 = '看管村裏特別的地方，例如村口、路口'. Confidence: MEDIUM-HIGH — specific shrine documented in study report, but exact shrine position within village not precisely geolocated.","check":"✔️","clearing_note":null,"photo_path":"B03P06.jpg"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[113.93443,22.27715]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"record_no":"P07","box_no":"B03","photo_no":"B03P07","remarks_raw":"春節間的伯公（龍井頭）","Location_note":"春節間的伯公（龍井頭）","latitude":22.27715,"longitude":113.93443,"coordinate_source":"Google Maps (user-provided) + OpenStreetMap + HK Gov sources + Tung Chung Tai O Study Report (PDF)","coordinate_confidence":"LOW-MEDIUM","coordinate_note":"龍井頭 (Lung Tseng Tau), Tung Chung (東涌), Lantau Island (大嶼山), Hong Kong. Coordinates: Google Maps (22.277148, 113.934428). Ref: Tung Chung–Tai O Study Report (東涌至大澳研究報告), PDF p.98 (printed p.70) Table 37: '龍井頭村的歷史建築／歷史地點：龍井頭神壇（伯公）' — Address: 龍井頭村; Purpose: 神明崇拜 (deity worship); Description: '有一紅色方框寫上橫批以及對聯，堆砌了幾塊石頭供奉伯公，後面有樹叢。' This directly matches the photo note '伯公 龍井頭村口' (P06) and '春節間的伯公（龍井頭）' (P07) — the 伯公 shrine at 龍井頭 village entrance. Also: PDF p.96 (printed p.68) §3.1.4 describes the village. PDF p.171 (printed p.143): 伯公 = '看管村裏特別的地方，例如村口、路口'. Confidence: MEDIUM-HIGH — specific shrine documented in study report, but exact shrine position within village not precisely geolocated.","check":"✔️","clearing_note":null,"photo_path":"B03P07.jpg"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[113.93443,22.27715]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"record_no":"P08","box_no":"B03","photo_no":"B03P08","remarks_raw":"龍井頭村口石頭崇拜","Location_note":"龍井頭村口石頭崇拜","latitude":22.27715,"longitude":113.93443,"coordinate_source":"Google Maps (user-provided) + OpenStreetMap + HK Gov sources + Tung Chung Tai O Study Report (PDF)","coordinate_confidence":"LOW-MEDIUM","coordinate_note":"龍井頭 (Lung Tseng Tau), Tung Chung, Lantau, Hong Kong. Coordinates: Google Maps (22.277148, 113.934428). Ref: Tung Chung–Tai O Study Report (東涌至大澳研究報告), PDF p.98 (printed p.70) Table 37: 龍井頭神壇（伯公）— '堆砌了幾塊石頭供奉伯公，後面有樹叢' (stones piled to worship 伯公, with trees behind). P08 '龍井頭村口石頭崇拜' = stone worship at village entrance — matches the documented 伯公 shrine with stone offerings. Confidence: MEDIUM-HIGH — specific shrine documented.","check":"✔️","clearing_note":null,"photo_path":"B03P08.jpg"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[113.93443,22.27715]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"record_no":"P09","box_no":"B03","photo_no":"B03P09","remarks_raw":"龍井4A側（樹枝及紅紙）","Location_note":"龍井4A側（樹枝及紅紙）","latitude":22.27715,"longitude":113.93443,"coordinate_source":"Google Maps (user-provided) + OpenStreetMap + HK Gov sources + Tung Chung Tai O Study Report (PDF)","coordinate_confidence":"LOW","coordinate_note":"龍井頭 (Lung Tseng Tau), Tung Chung (東涌), Lantau Island (大嶼山), Islands District (離島區), Hong Kong. Coordinates: Google Maps (user-provided: 22.277148, 113.934428). Also confirmed by: OpenStreetMap hamlet node (22.276171, 113.933930), HK Gov wastereduction.gov.hk (22.276964, 113.933678